{% doc %}
  Product finder quiz (Figma 1:506): dark panel with intro text and a white
  card holding a GET form. The steps are quiz-step blocks in the caller's body.
  Below 64rem the panel has one column, from 64rem two.

  Works without JavaScript: all steps show, and the form submits the chosen
  tags to the search page. With scripting enabled, CSS shows a step only after
  the previous steps have an answer, and the submit button only after the last
  one (assets/base.css). A script takes over by setting data-enhanced on the
  root. In the theme editor, data-design-mode keeps every step visible.

  Form parameters without JavaScript (drafts/techlead/ES1-T132/task-split.md D4,
  ES1-T133 #2, #3): hidden q=* and type=product, plus one filter.p.tag per
  checked option. The store must have the Product tag filter on in Search and
  Discovery; ES1-T140 records how Shopify treats the repeated parameter.

  Results (ES1-T132 D6, docs/ui-spec/quiz-result.md): partials quiz-results
  (cards) and quiz-results-actions ("View All N Matches" or "Shop All
  Equipment") are written here, after the form, because the swatches and the
  add forms of a card must stay out of the quiz form. With results_view
  (templates/collection.quiz.liquid, `?view=quiz`) the root is a plain div and
  the block renders the page: eyebrow, h1 "Your Gear Shortlist", the match
  count, the answers as pills (tag without the `quiz-` prefix), up to 4 cards
  (in stock first, card titles h2, first image eager), the actions and the
  empty state "No Exact Match". Without results_view both partials are empty
  and a script applies them from that template.

  results_popup (setting, default on; off in the theme editor): the results
  open in <modal-dialog data-layer="quiz"> (dialog L from 48rem, bottom sheet
  below, ADR 0007) instead of under the steps. Inside: close button, title,
  answer pills, count line (role="status", spinner + "Matching your gear…"
  while the panel has aria-busy), skeleton grid while busy, cards, empty
  state, load error, "Added to cart" notice region, quick view slot, and a
  footer with "Retake Quiz" + the actions partial.

  Card action (inside the partial, under each card): one variant in stock is a
  POST form to routes.cart_add_url (works without JavaScript); more variants is
  a link "Choose Options" to the product (quick view in the dialog with
  JavaScript, QZ2); sold out is a disabled "Sold Out". Built from
  product.variants_count, never product.variants (ADR 0008).

  A tag no product uses makes Shopify redirect to the URL without that tag
  (ES1-T133 #1), which would list too many products. So fewer current_tags than
  required_tags counts as 0 results.

  The empty state and its link sit outside the partial, because another
  template cannot read this block's settings. On collection.quiz the text comes
  from the locale; on the home page from the setting, or the locale when the
  setting is empty. Link "Shop All Equipment": setting collection, otherwise the
  current collection, otherwise all products. data-results-url uses the same
  value. The theme editor shows the panel and the empty state so the merchant
  can see the text.

  When the body is empty and results_view is off, the editor shows a placeholder
  and the storefront renders nothing.

  JavaScript hooks: custom element quiz-finder (root, id = static block id for
  the "Retake the quiz" link), data-enhanced, data-design-mode, data-lazy-module
  (URL of assets/quiz-finder.js, read by assets/lazy-module.js; neither renders
  in the theme editor or with results_view), data-results-url,
  data-results-view, data-label-results (%n stands for the count),
  data-label-loading, data-label-added, data-label-adding, data-quiz-submit
  (id {id}-submit), data-quiz-back, data-quiz-status, data-quiz-results-panel
  (aria-busy while loading), data-quiz-title (results heading, tabindex -1),
  data-quiz-count (partial root: number of cards; also data-quiz-total = all
  matches, data-quiz-summary = count sentence, data-view-all-url),
  data-quiz-empty, data-quiz-restart, data-quiz-dialog, data-quiz-close,
  data-quiz-answers + template[data-quiz-answer-template]
  ([data-quiz-answer-label]), data-quiz-results-status
  ([data-quiz-results-status-text]), data-quiz-error (button data-retry; its
  .empty-state__link gets the `?view=quiz` URL from the script), data-quiz-notice-region
  + template[data-quiz-notice-template] ([data-quiz-notice-product]),
  data-quiz-quick-view ([data-quiz-shortlist-back], [data-quiz-quick-view-body]),
  card: data-quiz-add-form, data-quiz-add ([data-quiz-add-label]),
  data-quiz-add-error (role="alert"), data-quiz-choose (data-product-url);
  actions partial: data-quiz-all, data-quiz-shop-all. Partials quiz-results,
  quiz-results-actions (fetch both in one call).
  Test hooks: data-testid="quiz", "quiz-eyebrow", "quiz-heading",
  "quiz-subheading", "quiz-note", "quiz-form", "quiz-submit", "quiz-back",
  "quiz-status", "quiz-placeholder", "quiz-results", "quiz-results-heading",
  "quiz-results-grid", "quiz-empty", "quiz-empty-heading", "quiz-empty-text",
  "quiz-empty-cta", "quiz-empty-retake", "quiz-dialog", "quiz-close",
  "quiz-restart", "quiz-answers", "quiz-answer", "quiz-results-status",
  "quiz-results-summary", "quiz-skeleton", "quiz-error" (+ "-heading",
  "-button", "-link"), "quiz-notice", "quiz-added", "quiz-quick-view",
  "quiz-quick-view-back", "quiz-results-actions", "quiz-view-all",
  "quiz-shop-all", "quiz-card-form", "quiz-card-add", "quiz-card-error",
  "quiz-card-choose", "quiz-card-sold-out", "quiz-page-eyebrow",
  "quiz-page-retake", "quiz-page-retake-link".

  @param {string} [content] - The quiz-step blocks of this quiz. Leave empty with results_view
  @param {string} [id] - Static block id, so this block keeps its own settings. Also the root id and the base of inner ids. Default: block.id
  @param {boolean} [results_popup] - Show the results in a popup instead of under the steps. Same as the setting; default: true
  @param {boolean} [results_view] - Render only the results page, with cards from the global collection. Default: false
  @param {number} [required_tags] - With results_view: tags the URL must apply, one per quiz step. Default: 3
  @param {string} [retake_anchor] - With results_view: id of the quiz block in templates/index.liquid, for "Retake the quiz" and "Change My Answers". Default: none (home page top)

  @example
  {% block 'container', id: 'home-quiz', tag: 'div' %}
    {% block 'quiz', id: 'quiz' %}
      {% block 'quiz-step', id: 'quiz-step-1', step: 1, total: 3 %}{% endblock %}
      {% block 'quiz-step', id: 'quiz-step-2', step: 2, total: 3 %}{% endblock %}
      {% block 'quiz-step', id: 'quiz-step-3', step: 3, total: 3 %}{% endblock %}
    {% endblock %}
  {% endblock %}

  @example
  {% block 'quiz', id: 'quiz-results', results_view: true, required_tags: 3, retake_anchor: 'quiz' %}{% endblock %}
{% enddoc %}

{%- liquid
  assign steps = content | strip
  assign eyebrow = block.settings.eyebrow
  assign heading = block.settings.heading
  assign subheading = block.settings.subheading
  assign note_1 = block.settings.note_1
  assign note_2 = block.settings.note_2
  assign quiz_id = id | default: block.id
  assign heading_id = quiz_id | append: '-heading'
  assign submit_id = quiz_id | append: '-submit'
  assign status_id = quiz_id | append: '-results-status'

  assign results_only = false
  if results_view == true
    assign results_only = true
  endif

  assign has_intro = false
  unless results_only
    if eyebrow != blank or heading != blank or subheading != blank or note_1 != blank or note_2 != blank
      assign has_intro = true
    endif
  endunless

  assign root_tag = 'quiz-finder'
  assign root_class = 'quiz'
  if results_only
    assign root_tag = 'div'
    assign root_class = 'quiz-page'
  elsif has_intro
    assign root_class = 'quiz quiz--split'
  endif

  assign results_popup = false
  if block.settings.results_popup and results_only == false and request.design_mode == false
    assign results_popup = true
  endif
  assign results_title_id = quiz_id | append: '-results-title'

  assign results_url = block.settings.collection.url | default: collection.url | default: routes.all_products_collection_url
  assign results_label = 'blocks.quiz.results_count' | t: count: '%n'

  assign retake_url = routes.root_url
  if retake_anchor != blank
    assign retake_url = routes.root_url | append: '#' | append: retake_anchor
  endif

  assign empty_text = 'blocks.quiz.empty_text' | t
  unless results_only
    assign empty_text = block.settings.empty_text | default: empty_text
  endunless

  # current_tags is nil without tags, and nil never compares as less than a number
  assign applied_tags = current_tags.size | default: 0
  assign tags_needed = required_tags | default: 3

  assign card_count = 0
  assign total = 0
  if results_only and applied_tags >= tags_needed
    assign card_count = collection.products.size | at_most: 4
    assign total = collection.products_count
  endif

  # View All: the same collection filtered by every tag, without ?view=quiz (QZ3)
  assign tag_path = ''
  for tag in current_tags
    assign tag_handle = tag | handleize
    if forloop.first
      assign tag_path = tag_handle
    else
      assign tag_path = tag_path | append: '+' | append: tag_handle
    endif
  endfor
  assign view_all_url = collection.url | append: '/' | append: tag_path

  assign summary = ''
  if card_count > 0
    assign summary = 'blocks.quiz.results_summary' | t: count: total, answers: tags_needed
    if total > card_count
      assign summary_top = 'blocks.quiz.results_top' | t: limit: card_count
      assign summary = summary | append: ' ' | append: summary_top
    endif
  endif

  # Liquid has no parentheses and reads and/or from the right, so these are separate checks
  assign empty_hidden = true
  if results_only or request.design_mode
    assign empty_hidden = false
  endif
  if card_count > 0
    assign empty_hidden = true
  endif

  assign empty_heading_tag = 'h3'
  if results_only
    assign empty_heading_tag = 'h2'
  endif
-%}

{%- if steps != blank or results_only -%}
  <{{ root_tag }}
    class="{{ root_class }}"
    {% unless results_only %}
      id="{{ quiz_id }}"
    {% endunless %}
    {% if request.design_mode %}
      data-design-mode
    {% endif %}
    {% unless results_only %}
      data-results-url="{{ results_url }}"
      data-results-view="quiz"
      data-label-results="{{ results_label | escape }}"
      data-label-loading="{{ 'blocks.quiz.loading' | t | escape }}"
      data-label-added="{{ 'blocks.quiz.added' | t | escape }}"
      data-label-adding="{{ 'blocks.quiz.adding' | t | escape }}"
    {% endunless %}
    {% unless results_only or request.design_mode %}
      data-lazy-module="{{ 'quiz-finder.js' | asset_url }}"
    {% endunless %}
    data-testid="quiz"
    {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
  >
    {%- if has_intro -%}
      <div class="quiz__intro">
        {%- if eyebrow != blank -%}
          <p class="quiz__eyebrow" data-testid="quiz-eyebrow">{{ eyebrow | escape }}</p>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if heading != blank -%}
          <h2 class="quiz__heading" id="{{ heading_id }}" data-testid="quiz-heading">{{ heading | escape }}</h2>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if subheading != blank -%}
          <p class="quiz__subheading" data-testid="quiz-subheading">{{ subheading | escape }}</p>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if note_1 != blank or note_2 != blank -%}
          <ul class="quiz__notes" role="list">
            {%- if note_1 != blank -%}
              <li class="quiz__note" data-testid="quiz-note">
                {%- render 'quiz-icon', name: 'clock' -%}
                {{- note_1 | escape -}}
              </li>
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- if note_2 != blank -%}
              <li class="quiz__note" data-testid="quiz-note">
                {%- render 'quiz-icon', name: 'badge' -%}
                {{- note_2 | escape -}}
              </li>
            {%- endif -%}
          </ul>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- unless results_only -%}
      <form
        class="quiz__form"
        action="{{ routes.search_url }}"
        method="get"
        {% if heading != blank %}
          aria-labelledby="{{ heading_id }}"
        {% endif %}
        data-testid="quiz-form"
      >
        <input type="hidden" name="q" value="*">
        <input type="hidden" name="type" value="product">
        {{ content }}
        <div class="quiz__actions">
          <button class="button button--secondary quiz__back" type="button" hidden data-quiz-back data-testid="quiz-back">
            {{- 'blocks.quiz.back' | t -}}
          </button>
          <button class="button quiz__submit" type="submit" id="{{ submit_id }}" data-quiz-submit data-testid="quiz-submit">
            {{- 'blocks.quiz.submit' | t -}}
          </button>
        </div>
        <div class="visually-hidden" role="status" data-quiz-status data-testid="quiz-status"></div>
      </form>
    {%- endunless -%}

    {%- if results_popup -%}
      {%- comment -%}
        Popup (CTO 09/11, ADR 0007): <modal-dialog> (assets/modal-dialog.js, BE) owns Esc, scrim,
        swipe, focus return; until it ships, assets/quiz-dialog.js calls showModal on [data-quiz-dialog].
        Without JavaScript the dialog never opens: the form goes to search.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <modal-dialog data-layer="quiz" data-sheet-below="48rem" data-return-focus="{{ submit_id }}">
      <dialog
        class="dialog dialog--l quiz__dialog"
        aria-labelledby="{{ results_title_id }}"
        aria-describedby="{{ status_id }}"
        data-quiz-dialog
        data-testid="quiz-dialog"
      >
      <button type="button" class="close-button dialog__close" aria-label="{{ 'blocks.quiz.close' | t }}" data-quiz-close data-testid="quiz-close">
        {%- render 'header-icon', name: 'close' -%}
      </button>
    {%- endif -%}

    <div
      class="quiz__results"
      {% unless results_only or request.design_mode %}
        hidden
      {% endunless %}
      data-quiz-results-panel
    >
      {%- if results_only -%}
        <div class="quiz-page__header">
          <p class="quiz-page__eyebrow" data-testid="quiz-page-eyebrow">{{ 'blocks.quiz.page_eyebrow' | t }}</p>
          <h1 class="quiz-page__title" id="{{ results_title_id }}" tabindex="-1" data-quiz-title data-testid="quiz-results-heading">
            {{- 'blocks.quiz.results_heading' | t -}}
          </h1>
          {%- if summary != blank -%}
            <p class="quiz-page__meta" data-testid="quiz-results-summary">{{ summary }}</p>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>

        {%- if applied_tags > 0 -%}
          <div class="quiz-page__answers">
            <p class="quiz-page__answers-label" id="{{ quiz_id }}-answers">{{ 'blocks.quiz.answers_label' | t }}</p>
            <ul class="quiz__answers" role="list" aria-labelledby="{{ quiz_id }}-answers" data-testid="quiz-answers">
              {%- for tag in current_tags -%}
                {%- assign tag_label = tag | remove_first: 'quiz-' | replace: '-', ' ' | capitalize -%}
                <li class="quiz__answer" data-testid="quiz-answer">
                  {%- render 'quiz-icon', name: 'check' -%}
                  {{- tag_label | escape -}}
                </li>
              {%- endfor -%}
            </ul>
            <a class="empty-state__link quiz-page__retake-link" href="{{ retake_url }}" data-testid="quiz-page-retake-link">
              {{- 'blocks.quiz.retake_link' | t -}}
            </a>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- else -%}
        <div class="quiz__results-header{% if results_popup %} dialog__header{% endif %}">
          <h2 class="quiz__results-heading{% if results_popup %} dialog__title{% endif %}" id="{{ results_title_id }}" tabindex="-1" data-quiz-title data-testid="quiz-results-heading">
            {{- 'blocks.quiz.results_heading' | t -}}
          </h2>
          <ul class="quiz__answers" role="list" aria-label="{{ 'blocks.quiz.answers_list' | t }}" data-quiz-answers data-testid="quiz-answers"></ul>
          <template data-quiz-answer-template>
            <li class="quiz__answer" data-testid="quiz-answer">
              {%- render 'quiz-icon', name: 'check' -%}
              <span data-quiz-answer-label></span>
            </li>
          </template>
          <p class="quiz__results-status" id="{{ status_id }}" role="status" data-quiz-results-status data-testid="quiz-results-status">
            <span class="quiz__loading">
              <span class="spinner" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              {{- 'blocks.quiz.loading' | t -}}
            </span>
            <span data-quiz-results-status-text></span>
          </p>
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}

      <div class="quiz__results-main{% if results_popup %} dialog__body{% endif %}">
        {%- unless results_only -%}
          <div class="quiz__notice-region" role="status" data-quiz-notice-region data-testid="quiz-notice"></div>
          <template data-quiz-notice-template>
            <div class="quiz__notice" data-testid="quiz-added">
              <span class="quiz__notice-icon">{% render 'status-icon', name: 'success' %}</span>
              <p class="quiz__notice-text">
                <strong>{{ 'blocks.product_form.added_to_cart' | t }}</strong>
                <span data-quiz-notice-product></span>
              </p>
              <a class="empty-state__link quiz__notice-link" href="{{ routes.cart_url }}">{{ 'blocks.quiz.view_cart' | t }}</a>
            </div>
          </template>

          <ul class="quiz__results-grid quiz__skeleton" role="list" aria-hidden="true" data-testid="quiz-skeleton">
            {%- for i in (1..4) -%}
              <li class="skeleton-card">
                <span class="skeleton skeleton--media"></span>
                <span class="skeleton skeleton--line"></span>
                <span class="skeleton skeleton--line skeleton--short"></span>
                <span class="skeleton quiz__skeleton-button"></span>
              </li>
            {%- endfor -%}
          </ul>
        {%- endunless -%}

        {% partial 'quiz-results' %}
          <div
            class="quiz__results-body"
            data-quiz-count="{{ card_count }}"
            data-quiz-total="{{ total }}"
            data-quiz-summary="{{ summary | escape }}"
            data-view-all-url="{{ view_all_url }}"
            data-testid="quiz-results"
          >
            {%- if card_count > 0 -%}
              <ul class="quiz__results-grid" role="list" data-testid="quiz-results-grid">
                {%- comment -%} In stock first, sold out only to fill up to 4 (quiz-result.md §4) {%- endcomment -%}
                {%- assign shown = 0 -%}
                {%- for pass in (1..2) -%}
                  {%- for item in collection.products -%}
                    {%- liquid
                      if shown >= card_count
                        break
                      endif

                      assign card_product = item
                      assign card_variant = nil
                      assign add_variant = item.selected_or_first_available_variant
                      if item.product != blank
                        assign card_product = item.product
                        assign card_variant = item
                        assign add_variant = item
                      endif

                      assign take = false
                      if pass == 1 and item.available
                        assign take = true
                      elsif pass == 2 and item.available == false
                        assign take = true
                      endif

                      assign card_loading = 'lazy'
                      if shown == 0
                        assign card_loading = 'eager'
                      endif
                    -%}
                    {%- if take -%}
                      {%- assign shown = shown | plus: 1 -%}
                      <li class="quiz__results-item">
                        {% render 'product-card',
                          product: card_product,
                          variant: card_variant,
                          sizes: '(min-width: 80rem) 336px, (min-width: 48rem) 170px, 50vw',
                          loading: card_loading,
                          card_context: 'recommendation',
                          heading_level: 'h2'
                        %}
                        <div class="quiz__card-action">
                          {%- if item.available == false -%}
                            <button type="button" class="button button--secondary quiz__card-button" disabled data-testid="quiz-card-sold-out">
                              <span aria-hidden="true">{{ 'blocks.quiz.sold_out' | t }}</span>
                              <span class="visually-hidden">{{ 'blocks.quiz.card_sold_out' | t: title: card_product.title }}</span>
                            </button>
                          {%- elsif card_variant == nil and card_product.variants_count > 1 -%}
                            <a
                              class="button button--secondary quiz__card-button"
                              href="{{ card_product.url }}"
                              data-quiz-choose
                              data-product-url="{{ card_product.url }}"
                              data-testid="quiz-card-choose"
                            >
                              <span aria-hidden="true">{{ 'blocks.quiz.choose_options' | t }}</span>
                              <span class="visually-hidden">{{ 'blocks.quiz.card_choose' | t: title: card_product.title }}</span>
                            </a>
                          {%- else -%}
                            <form class="quiz__card-form" method="post" action="{{ routes.cart_add_url }}" data-quiz-add-form data-testid="quiz-card-form">
                              <input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ add_variant.id }}">
                              <input type="hidden" name="quantity" value="1">
                              <button type="submit" class="button button--secondary quiz__card-button" data-quiz-add data-testid="quiz-card-add">
                                {%- render 'header-icon', name: 'bag' -%}
                                <span aria-hidden="true" data-quiz-add-label>{{ 'blocks.product_form.add_to_cart' | t }}</span>
                                <span class="visually-hidden">{{ 'blocks.quiz.card_add' | t: title: card_product.title }}</span>
                              </button>
                              <p class="quiz__card-error" role="alert" data-quiz-add-error data-testid="quiz-card-error"></p>
                            </form>
                          {%- endif -%}
                        </div>
                      </li>
                    {%- endif -%}
                  {%- endfor -%}
                {%- endfor -%}
              </ul>
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>
        {% endpartial %}

        <div
          class="empty-state quiz__empty"
          {% if empty_hidden %}
            hidden
          {% endif %}
          data-quiz-empty
          data-testid="quiz-empty"
        >
          <span class="empty-state__icon">{% render 'status-icon', name: 'box' %}</span>
          <{{ empty_heading_tag }} class="empty-state__heading" data-testid="quiz-empty-heading">
            {{- 'blocks.quiz.empty_heading' | t -}}
          </{{ empty_heading_tag }}>
          <p class="empty-state__text quiz__empty-text" data-testid="quiz-empty-text">{{ empty_text | escape }}</p>
          <div class="empty-state__actions">
            {%- if results_only -%}
              <a class="button" href="{{ retake_url }}" data-testid="quiz-empty-retake">
                {{- 'blocks.quiz.change_answers' | t -}}
              </a>
            {%- endif -%}
            <a class="button button--secondary" href="{{ results_url }}" data-testid="quiz-empty-cta">
              {{- 'blocks.quiz.shop_all' | t -}}
            </a>
            {%- if results_popup -%}
              <button type="button" class="button" data-quiz-restart data-testid="quiz-empty-retake">
                {{- 'blocks.quiz.change_answers' | t -}}
              </button>
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>
        </div>

        {%- unless results_only -%}
          {%- assign error_heading = 'blocks.quiz.error_heading' | t -%}
          {%- assign error_text = 'blocks.quiz.error_text' | t -%}
          {%- assign error_link = 'blocks.quiz.error_link' | t -%}
          <div class="quiz__error" hidden data-quiz-error>
            {% render 'empty-state',
              kind: 'error',
              heading: error_heading,
              heading_tag: 'h3',
              text: error_text,
              link_label: error_link,
              link_url: results_url,
              testid: 'quiz-error'
            %}
          </div>

          <div class="quiz__quick-view" hidden data-quiz-quick-view data-testid="quiz-quick-view">
            <button type="button" class="quiz__shortlist-back" data-quiz-shortlist-back data-testid="quiz-quick-view-back">
              {%- render 'slideshow-icon', name: 'arrow' -%}
              {{- 'blocks.quiz.back_to_list' | t -}}
            </button>
            <div data-quiz-quick-view-body></div>
          </div>
        {%- endunless -%}
      </div>

      {%- liquid
        assign actions_class = 'quiz__results-actions-row'
        if results_popup
          assign actions_class = 'dialog__footer quiz__dialog-actions'
        elsif results_only
          assign actions_class = 'quiz-page__actions'
        endif
      -%}
      <div
        class="{{ actions_class }}"
        {% if results_only and card_count == 0 %}
          hidden
        {% endif %}
      >
        {%- if results_popup -%}
          <button type="button" class="button button--secondary" data-quiz-restart data-testid="quiz-restart">
            {{- 'blocks.quiz.restart' | t -}}
          </button>
        {%- endif -%}
        {% partial 'quiz-results-actions' %}
          <div class="quiz__results-actions" data-testid="quiz-results-actions">
            {%- if card_count > 0 -%}
              {%- if total > card_count -%}
                <a class="button" href="{{ view_all_url }}" data-quiz-all data-testid="quiz-view-all">
                  {{- 'blocks.quiz.view_all' | t: total: total -}}
                  {% render 'slideshow-icon', name: 'arrow' %}
                </a>
              {%- else -%}
                <a class="button" href="{{ results_url }}" data-quiz-shop-all data-testid="quiz-shop-all">
                  {{- 'blocks.quiz.shop_all' | t -}}
                  {% render 'slideshow-icon', name: 'arrow' %}
                </a>
              {%- endif -%}
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>
        {% endpartial %}
        {%- if results_only -%}
          <a class="button button--secondary" href="{{ retake_url }}" data-testid="quiz-page-retake">
            {{- 'blocks.quiz.restart' | t -}}
          </a>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    </div>
    {%- if results_popup -%}
      </dialog>
      </modal-dialog>
      <script src="{{ 'quiz-dialog.js' | asset_url }}" type="module"></script>
    {%- endif -%}

    <script src="{{ 'product-swatch.js' | asset_url }}" type="module"></script>
    {%- unless results_only or request.design_mode -%}
      <script src="{{ 'lazy-module.js' | asset_url }}" type="module"></script>
    {%- endunless -%}
  </{{ root_tag }}>
{%- elsif request.design_mode -%}
  <p class="quiz-placeholder" data-testid="quiz-placeholder" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
    {{ 'blocks.quiz.placeholder' | t }}
  </p>
{%- endif -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "t:general.quiz",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "eyebrow",
      "label": "t:labels.eyebrow",
      "default": "Our most-loved feature"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "t:labels.heading",
      "default": "Find Your Perfect Gear"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "subheading",
      "label": "t:labels.quiz_subheading",
      "default": "Two questions. One shortlist."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "note_1",
      "label": "t:labels.quiz_note_1",
      "info": "t:info.quiz_note",
      "default": "20 seconds"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "note_2",
      "label": "t:labels.quiz_note_2",
      "info": "t:info.quiz_note",
      "default": "No sign-up required"
    },
    {
      "type": "collection",
      "id": "collection",
      "label": "t:labels.collection",
      "info": "t:info.quiz_collection"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "results_popup",
      "label": "t:labels.quiz_results_popup",
      "info": "t:info.quiz_results_popup",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "empty_text",
      "label": "t:labels.quiz_empty_text",
      "info": "t:info.quiz_empty_text"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
